  "Description": {
    "Cost": 5310298,
    "UIName": "Dyrnwyn",
    "Id": "chassisdef_dyrnwyn_DYR-Prime",
    "Name": "Dyrnwyn",
    "Details": "The Prime configuration of the Dyrnwyn, the Society's high-performance jumping OmniMech built around an advanced Partial Wing System, carries a Vibro Sword in its right arm, recalling the blazing sword that gave the design its name. Four ER Small Lasers in the center torso exploit any holes the blade opens, while Triple Strength Myomer adds force to its blows. Jump jets and the partial wings let it quickly reach its targets despite the short range of its weapons, and hardened upper arm actuators and reinforced leg actuators strengthen its limbs for melee combat.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Nimble</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.03</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
    "Icon": "Dyrnwyn"
  },
