  "YangsThoughts": "Now this is a ’Mech for somebody who likes making an entrance. Those wings and jump jets can put the Dyrnwyn right on top of a target, and that Vibroblade ought to carve a nice opening for the ER Small Lasers to finish the job. Just make sure you’re as good a pilot as that sword says you’re supposed to be.",
